conditions of residence of students of the Institute and the levying of the fees for residence in the halls and hostels and
other charges;
(l)
manner of filling up of vacancies among members of the Governing Council;
(m)
allowances to be paid to the Chairperson and members of the Governing Council;
(n)
authentication of the orders and decisions of the Governing Council;
(o)
meetings of the Governing Council, Senate, or any Committee, the quorum at such meetings and the procedure to be
followed in the conduct of their business;
(p)
any other matter which by this Act is to be or may be prescribed by the Statutes.
